WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.091
To fill this gap, the authors build FLAb, the
Fitness Landscape for Antibodies,

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:09.476
the largest therapeutic antibody design benchmark
assembled so far.

00:00:09.556 --> 00:00:16.676
It curates seventeen mutational landscapes with
more than thirteen thousand experimental fitness measurements,

00:00:16.756 --> 00:00:19.229
spanning six developability properties.

00:00:19.309 --> 00:00:20.604
Using this benchmark,

00:00:20.684 --> 00:00:27.215
they evaluate six widely adopted pretrained protein
models and compare them to physics-based Rosetta.

00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:28.524
Just as importantly,

00:00:28.604 --> 00:00:33.760
all of the FLAb data are released openly so the
community can keep expanding it.
